/**
@page implementation_notes Implementation Notes

- Fast loop: 20 kHz, no blocking, no flash, no slow OD operations.
- Motion loop: 1-2 kHz, trajectory, state estimator, position and velocity loops.
- Slow loop: 10-100 Hz, communications, diagnostics, persistence service.
- Rate crossings use explicit buffers.
- Internal units are SI.
- BLDC-specific id/iq, electrical angle and SVPWM stay inside the BLDC/FOC backend.
*/
